.sectaux 0 Abstract
.underline off
.justify
.sp
This document describes how to use the ${lgname}
on a daily basis.
It charts the development of a user class and a
matching application.
Installation is outlined.
The ${lgname} is based on a system similar to Objective-C
as outlined by Brad Cox [Cox86].
A bibliography of related materials is also included.
.!
.restore
.st -16
